      "claim": "Total people for the remaining days = 4 × 60 = 240.",
      "evidence": "Average of 60 people each of the 4 days.",
      "weight": 0.1,
      "depends_on": [6]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "claim": "Total people Conor saw that week = 260 + 240 = 500.",
